asurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"discrete-and-continuous-data\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 6 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 6 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 6 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Numerical variable count বা measurement represent করতে পারে। এই distinction possible value, chart, probability model ও data collection-এ কী প্রভাব ফেলে তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Numerical variables can represent counts or measurements. Learn why the distinction affects possible values, charts, probability models, and data collection.\">Numerical variables can represent counts or measurements. Learn why the distinction affects possible values, charts, probability models, and data collection.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 35 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Discrete ও continuous variable define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define discrete and continuous variables.\">Define discrete and continuous variables.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Count ও measurement classify করুন।\" data-en=\"Classify counts and measurements.\">Classify counts and measurements.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Recorded precision বুঝুন।\" data-en=\"Understand recorded precision.\">Understand recorded precision.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Rounding interpretation পরিবর্তন করলে তা চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize when rounding changes interpretation.\">Recognize when rounding changes interpretation.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Discrete data\" data-en=\"Discrete data\">Discrete data</h2><p data-bn=\"Discrete numerical data separate countable value নেয়, সাধারণত counting থেকে: order, defect, student বা website session সংখ্যা। Valid count-এর মাঝের value impossible হতে পারে; এক household-এ 3.6 person হয় না।\" data-en=\"Discrete numerical data take separate countable values, usually from counting: number of orders, defects, students, or website sessions. Values between valid counts may be impossible; a household cannot contain 3.6 people in one observation.\">Discrete numerical data take separate countable values, usually from counting: number of orders, defects, students, or website sessions. Values between valid counts may be impossible; a household cannot contain 3.6 people in one observation.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Continuous data\" data-en=\"Continuous data\">Continuous data</h2><p data-bn=\"Continuous data measurement থেকে আসে এবং interval-এর মধ্যে theoretically যেকোনো value নিতে পারে: weight, temperature, time, distance বা finer precision revenue। Recorded value instrument বা system precision অনুযায়ী rounded হয়।\" data-en=\"Continuous data arise from measurement and can theoretically take any value within an interval: weight, temperature, time, distance, or revenue measured with finer precision. Recorded values are always rounded to the precision of the instrument or system.\">Continuous data arise from measurement and can theoretically take any value within an interval: weight, temperature, time, distance, or revenue measured with finer precision. Recorded values are always rounded to the precision of the instrument or system.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Context গুরুত্বপূর্ণ\" data-en=\"Context matters\">Context matters</h2><p data-bn=\"Age precisely measured হলে continuous, কিন্তু completed year-এ recorded হলে discrete দেখায়। Money currency unit-এ recorded হলেও analysis-এ continuous হিসেবে treat করা হয়। Label-এর বদলে operational definition ও precision লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Age can be continuous when measured precisely but appears discrete when recorded in completed years. Money is technically recorded in currency units, yet often treated as continuous for analytical models. State the operational definition and precision rather than relying only on labels.\">Age can be continuous when measured precisely but appears discrete when recorded in completed years. Money is technically recorded in currency units, yet often treated as continuous for analytical models. State the operational definition and precision rather than relying only on labels.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Discrete\" data-en=\"Discrete\">Discrete</h3><p data-bn=\"Possible value-এর মধ্যে gap-সহ countable numerical value।\" data-en=\"Countable numerical values with gaps between possible values.\">Countable numerical values with gaps between possible values.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Continuous\" data-en=\"Continuous\">Continuous</h3><p data-bn=\"Interval জুড়ে vary করতে পারে এমন measured numerical value।\" data-en=\"Measured numerical values that can vary across an interval.\">Measured numerical values that can vary across an interval.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Precision\" data-en=\"Precision\">Precision</h3><p data-bn=\"Recorded smallest unit বা decimal detail।\" data-en=\"The smallest unit or decimal detail recorded.\">The smallest unit or decimal detail recorded.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Rounding\" data-en=\"Rounding\">Rounding</h3><p data-bn=\"Chosen precision-এ nearby value দিয়ে replace করা।\" data-en=\"Replacing a value with a nearby value at a chosen precision.\">Replacing a value with a nearby value at a chosen precision.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Delivery operation\" data-en=\"Delivery operations\">Delivery operations</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Courier packages per rider, delivery duration, distance ও customer rating record করে।\" data-en=\"A courier records packages per rider, delivery duration, distance, and customer rating.\">A courier records packages per rider, delivery duration, distance, and customer rating.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"packages discrete count।\" data-en=\"packages is a discrete count.\">packages is a discrete count.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"duration ও distance continuous measurement।\" data-en=\"duration and distance are continuous measurements.\">duration and distance are continuous measurements.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Rating 1–5 ordinal categorical, continuous নয়।\" data-en=\"rating 1–5 is ordinal categorical, not continuous.\">rating 1–5 is ordinal categorical, not continuous.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Duration whole minute-এ round করলে recorded value discrete দেখালেও underlying concept continuous।\" data-en=\"If duration is rounded to whole minutes, the recorded values look discrete but the underlying concept remains continuous.\">If duration is rounded to whole minutes, the recorded values look discrete but the underlying concept remains continuous.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Classification quantity কীভাবে generate ও use হয় তা reflect করবে।\" data-en=\"Classification should reflect how the quantity is generated and used.\">Classification should reflect how the quantity is generated and used.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Count সাধারণত discrete।\" data-en=\"Counts are usually discrete.\">Counts are usually discrete.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Measurement সাধারণত continuous।\" data-en=\"Measurements are usually continuous.\">Measurements are usually continuous.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Recorded precision সবসময় underlying type বদলায় না।\" data-en=\"Recorded precision does not always change the underlying type.\">Recorded precision does not always change the underlying type.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Context ও operational definition গুরুত্বপূর্ণ।\" data-en=\"Context and operational definitions matter.\">Context and operational definitions matter.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-2-data-sampling-and-variation-in-data-and-sampling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Data, Sampling, and Variation ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-3-frequency-frequency-tables-and-levels-of-measurement\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Frequency Tables and Levels of Measurement ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/categorical-and-numerical-data/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/measurement-scales/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}